{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI am in Cologne, tired but content. The journey has been pleasant, though my knees protest the sulphur bath I took in Aachen after a long day. I confess I spent hours in the morning and afternoon viewing Bettendorf’s paintings, accompanied by the collector himself. It was a fine display, though I found myself thinking of how art reveals the spirit’s inwardness better than dry philosophy.\n\nThe strangest moment came when the sexton let me sit in Charlemagne’s coronation chair. I felt a sudden, absurd weight of history. One imagines the pomp of that era, yet here I sat, just an old professor in a dusty room. It reminded me that even the greatest moments are fleeting, like the smoke from my snuffbox.\n\nI reached Liège late yesterday and stayed with a fellow passenger. The roads are good. I hope you and the boys are well. I think of you constantly.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080264,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":205,"prompt_tokens":947,"total_tokens":1152,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-A6Z0hDtZjVhSRYAoVA9KrwYNxhE6mxg5","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":947,"prompt_ms":986.071,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.041257655755016,"prompt_per_second":960.3770925217351,"predicted_n":205,"predicted_ms":4920.158,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.118421568627454,"predicted_per_second":41.46208312822474}}